Co-operative Mode
- Play CAMPAIGN maps and BATTLEMODE arenas with friends.
- At least one player should select a Slayer on the left podium slot.

Invasion Mode
- Play CAMPAIGN maps with Demon Players hunting the Slayer.
- The Slayer must complete all encounters. The Demons must kill the Slayer.

Slayer vs Slayer
- Engage in Slayer vs Slayer combat within BATTLEMODE & CAMPAIGN maps.
- Win 3 rounds to claim victory or participate in endless rounds.
